<details id="link-editor-panel" class="link-editor-panel"><summary>Article links: add, edit, or remove</summary>
<p class="small">Select plain article text or place its cursor, then choose Use current article selection. Place the cursor inside an existing inline link to edit it, or choose one below. No destination page is fetched or verified.</p>
<button id="link-use-selection" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Use current article selection</button><p id="link-target-status" class="small">Choose a location or an existing link.</p>
<label for="link-label">Link text</label><textarea id="link-label" rows="2" maxlength="300" disabled aria-describedby="link-label-help"></textarea><p id="link-label-help" class="small">Describe where the link leads, up to 300 characters on one line. Surrounding article text and spaces are kept exactly.</p>
<label for="link-url">Destination URL</label><textarea id="link-url" rows="2" maxlength="2048" inputmode="url" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" disabled aria-describedby="link-url-help"></textarea><p id="link-url-help" class="small">An absolute HTTP or HTTPS address, up to 2,048 characters. No credentials, spaces, quoted titles, or multiline URLs. The entered address is preserved in Markdown.</p>
<div class="actions"><button id="link-preview" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Preview link change</button><button id="link-preview-remove" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Preview removing link, keep its text</button></div>
<div id="link-change-preview" hidden><h3>Review the exact link change</h3><label for="link-before">Selected text to replace</label><textarea id="link-before" rows="2" readonly></textarea><label for="link-after">Markdown to insert</label><textarea id="link-after" rows="3" readonly></textarea></div>
<div class="actions"><button id="link-apply" type="button" class="button" disabled>Apply link change</button><button id="link-discard" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Discard link preparation</button></div>
<p id="link-editor-status" class="small" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Link editor is loading. You can edit Markdown directly.</p>
<details id="article-link-list-panel"><summary>Inspect the links in this article</summary><p id="article-link-status" class="small"></p><ol id="article-link-list" class="article-link-list" aria-label="Article inline links"></ol><button id="download-link-notes" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Download link review notes</button></details>
<p class="small">Applying checkpoints previous writing and clears export approval and the WordPress linked-image choice. Article edits invalidate pending locations. Closing this panel clears its preview and keeps preparation. Unsaved link preparation is excluded from backups, collections, and exports; apply first to keep it. <a href="/help/local-workspace/#link-editor" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Link editing help (new tab)</a></p>
</details>
